.
.  Generate sample output for Double Exponetial PPF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
set ipl1na dexppf.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Double Exponential PPF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
X1LABEL Probability
Y1LABEL X
.
PLOT DEXPPF(P) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv DEXPPF.PS dexppf.ps
.
quit
